click-choreography

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Let a tape overlap steps with Back, and with Set ClickLead draw a click's press ahead of the event: the pointer shrinks over the lead, holds, and grows back before the click ends. Without a lead a click draws as before.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream evp supports overlapping steps and a press lead for drawn clicks.
